          <li>Note A: Trainerize's pricing page shows Grow at $9 per month on its plan card and $10 per month in its FAQ and comparison table, with similar pairs for Pro 5 ($23 and $25) and Studio Plus ($248 and $275). Trainerize's own cost guide, dated October 30, 2026, lists the higher figure in each pair as the monthly billing price and the lower figure as the per-month price on annual billing. Trainerize's AI coaching article also refers to the "Grow plan ($9/month)".</li>
          <li>Note B: My PT Hub's pricing page lists its Lite plan as "Free" for 1 client, and its FAQ says accounts move to the Lite plan at the end of the 30-day trial.</li>
