          <li>Everfit help, AI Smart Response credits and plans: <a href="https://help.everfit.io/en/articles/16881431-ai-smart-response-credits-and-plans" rel="noopener">https://help.everfit.io/en/articles/16881431-ai-smart-response-credits-and-plans</a></li>
          <li>Everfit help, Zapier integration: <a href="https://help.everfit.io/en/articles/8543585-introducing-zapier-integration" rel="noopener">https://help.everfit.io/en/articles/8543585-introducing-zapier-integration</a></li>
